The root cause of the bug is that the current implementation does not consider the visibility of the parent group layer when determining whether to display attributions for sub-layers. The `getAttributions` method in the `Layer` class should check the visibility of the entire layer hierarchy, not just the individual layer.

### Bug Location and Fix
